# Codex-RS Architecture Context

## Layer Communication

```
TUI Layer (App) → Core Layer (ThreadManager → CodexThread → Codex)
               ← Events via async channel
```

## Critical Facts

1. TUI uses ThreadManager DIRECTLY
2. MessageProcessor is ONLY for external JSON-RPC (VS Code)
3. Communication: submit(Op) → recv() Event
4. ApprovalOverlay maintains a QUEUE of requests

## Key File Mappings

| Component | File |
|-----------|------|
| App | codex-rs/tui/src/app.rs |
| ThreadManager | codex-rs/core/src/thread_manager.rs |
| CodexThread | codex-rs/core/src/codex_thread.rs |
| Op, EventMsg | codex-rs/protocol/src/protocol.rs |

